LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HearMrFujiNotFromAroundHere::
    .string "I recently moved to this town.\p"
    .string "I hear that MR. FUJI's not from\n"
    .string "these parts originally, either.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_WhereDidMrFujiGo::
    .string "Mr. Fuji isn't here.\n"
    .string "Where'd he go?\p"
    .string "He left his\n"
    .string "record books open.\p"
    .string "Four names on\n"
    .string "every page.\p"
    .string "Different handwriting each time.\p"
    .string "Very old paper.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MrFujiWasPrayingForCubonesMother::
    .string "Mr. Fuji had\n"
    .string "been praying alone\n"
    .string "for Cubone's mother.\p"
    .string "He also prayed\n"
    .string "for something else.\p"
    .string "He won't say what.\p"
    .string "But the record\n"
    .string "books are closed now.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MrFujiLooksAfterOrphanedMons::
    .string "This is Mr.\n"
    .string "Fuji's house.\n"
    .string "He's very kind.\p"
    .string "He looks after\n"
    .string "abandoned Pokemon.\p"
    .string "He also looks\n"
    .string "after old records.\p"
    .string "Four names written\n"
    .string "in very old script.\p"
    .string "He won't say\n"
    .string "where he found them.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MonsNiceToHug::
    .string "It's so warm!\n"
    .string "Pokemon are nice to hug.\p"
    .string "The Pokemon here\n"
    .string "have been restless.\p"
    .string "They face the\n"
    .string "Tower at night.\p"
    .string "All of them.\n"
    .string "At the same time.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_Nidorino::
    .string "NIDORINO: Gaoo!\p"
    .string "NIDORINO faces the\n"
    .string "Tower and growls.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_Psyduck::
    .string "PSYDUCK: Gwappa!\p"
    .string "PSYDUCK holds its\n"
    .string "head.\n"
    .string "More than usual.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_IdLikeYouToHaveThis::
    .string "MR. FUJI: {PLAYER}…\p"
    .string "Your POKéDEX quest is one that\n"
    .string "requires strong dedication.\p"
    .string "Without deep love for POKéMON,\n"
    .string "your quest may fail.\p"
    .string "I'm not sure if this will help you,\n"
    .string "but I'd like you to have it.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_ReceivedPokeFluteFromMrFuji::
    .string "{PLAYER} received a POKé FLUTE\n"
    .string "from MR. FUJI.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_ExplainPokeFlute::
    .string "Upon hearing the POKé FLUTE,\n"
    .string "sleeping POKéMON will spring awake.\p"
    .string "Try using it on POKéMON that are\n"
    .string "sleeping obstacles.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_MustMakeRoomForThis::
    .string "You must make room for this!$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_HasPokeFluteHelpedYou::
    .string "MR. FUJI: Has\n"
    .string "my Poke Flute\n"
    .string "helped you?\p"
    .string "The flute calms\n"
    .string "sleeping Pokemon.\p"
    .string "I have played\n"
    .string "it in the\n"
    .string "Tower at night.\p"
    .string "It does not\n"
    .string "calm what waits\n"
    .string "on the upper floors.\p"
    .string "Different kind of waiting.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_GrandPrizeDrawingClipped::
    .string "POKEMON FAN MAGAZINE\n"
    .string "Monthly Grand Prize Drawing!\p"
    .string "Application form gone.\n"
    .string "Someone applied already.\p"
    .string "Also four names\n"
    .string "written in the margin.\p"
    .string "Not a contest entry.$"

LavenderTown_VolunteerPokemonHouse_Text_PokemonMagazinesLineShelf::
    .string "Pokemon magazines.\n"
    .string "Pokemon Insider.\n"
    .string "Pokemon Fan.\p"
    .string "One book is\n"
    .string "not a magazine.\p"
    .string "Very old.\n"
    .string "No title.\p"
    .string "Four names repeated\n"
    .string "on every page.\p"
    .string "Different languages.\n"
    .string "Same four names.$"

